%!
% PDF/X-1a:2001 definition for Ghostscript (used by tools/make_pdfx.sh).
% Output intent: U.S. Web Coated (SWOP) characterization (CGATS TR 001), profile = Ghostscript's default_cmyk.icc.
[ /GTS_PDFXVersion (PDF/X-1a:2001)
  /GTS_PDFXConformance (PDF/X-1a:2001)
  /Title (Hands-On AI for Kids - Chapter 1 - Welcome to AI World)
  /Trapped /False
/DOCINFO pdfmark
/ICCProfile (/usr/share/color/icc/ghostscript/default_cmyk.icc) def
[/_objdef {icc_PDFX} /type /stream /OBJ pdfmark
[{icc_PDFX} << /N 4 >> /PUT pdfmark
[{icc_PDFX} ICCProfile (r) file /PUT pdfmark
[/_objdef {OutputIntent_PDFX} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[{OutputIntent_PDFX} <<
  /Type /OutputIntent
  /S /GTS_PDFX
  /OutputCondition (U.S. Web Coated (SWOP))
  /Info (U.S. Web Coated (SWOP))
  /OutputConditionIdentifier (CGATS TR 001)
  /RegistryName (http://www.color.org)
  /DestOutputProfile {icc_PDFX}
>> /PUT pdfmark
[{Catalog} <</OutputIntents [ {OutputIntent_PDFX} ]>> /PUT pdfmark
